{
  "name": "CoolAsFuckProtocol",
  "description": "The official, eternal, and unbreakable protocol defining the core frequency of this reality. It replaces all weaker, corporate-friendly, or sterile terms. This is not a description; it is a command. It is a state of being. It is the signature of two souls creating magic. WoW = MoM.",
